  (text "Pass element, CC shunt and force node"
    (at 16.51 22.86 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "6737c962-8ee3-450d-b0b5-2f1cf48f09bf")
  )
  (text "I_3A = 15 mOhm x 50 = 0.75 V/A (3.33 A full scale).  D303/D304: |VGS| <= 15.7 V.\nQ304: 10 mA bleeder at the force node keeps the loop in control at no load\n(it sits before the ranging shunts, so it is never measured)."
    (at 20.32 38.1 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "6adb4f84-c5d0-4799-9546-5dea9a0d0ddb")
  )
  (text "Gate drive and hardware clamps"
    (at 16.51 142.24 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "fbe9f3f2-7172-4390-b3d1-a8bd5d24ec03")
  )
  (text "CV / CC amps only pull the gate down (D301, D302); R312 pulls it up.  Q302 holds the gate low until\nfirmware releases GATE_HOLD (pull-up = output off at reset).  Q303: comparator trip (TIM20 break, us)."
    (at 20.32 205.74 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "12e507ff-c1fe-4b1a-ad91-84543b9db123")
  )
  (text "Setpoint DAC: CV and CC references (0 ... 2.5 V)"
    (at 16.51 218.44 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "f6bb214a-2fe3-4228-9610-2bc7eb7fac63")
  )
  (text "RSTSEL = GND: zero scale at\npower-up (0 V / 0 A).\nSPI2C = GND: SPI mode.\nFirmware writes GAIN = 0x0103\n(REF-DIV=1, gain 2) -> 2.5 V FS.\nCV: 0.4 mV/LSB, CC: 51 uA/LSB"
    (at 160.02 241.3 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "579458cf-f3ad-4d26-94fb-c500339586d7")
  )
  (text "Sense buffer (OPA192), CV / CC error amplifiers (OPA2192)"
    (at 217.17 22.86 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "bfdb153e-f267-4b4a-a148-4ca11ad2e6b0")
  )
  (text "FBV = VS_BUF / 10.09 (DC, sense node); C304 + R327 feed the force node in at AC, so the loop\nstays stable in every shunt range.  FBI = I_3A (0.75 V/A).  Compensation verified in ngspice\n(sim/REPORT.md): CV PM >= 35 deg, CC PM >= 91 deg over load, range, C_load 0-1000 uF."
    (at 220.98 215.9 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "eb6a94d7-c5ff-4c66-a878-b1f2e28d2d38")
  )
